title: Labor
new-page: true
is-card: true
on-arrival: labor_policy_timer += 2; week_actions += 1
view-if: labor_policy_timer == 0 and labor_minister_party = "Bolshevik"
tags: sovnarkom, government
card-image: img/labor.jpg

= Labor

- @administration
- @goto_labor_affairs
- @unions
- @policies
- @programs
- @labor_null
- @root: Do not change labor policy
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@labor_null
title: -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
go-to: labor

@labor_return
title: Cancel action.
go-to: labor

  
@administration
title: ADMINISTRATION

- @improve_admin
- @hire_staff
- @corruption
- @labor_return

@improve_admin
title: Streamline the commissariat
subtitle: Cut waste and inefficiencies, increase labor intensity
choose-if: labor_corruption = 0
unavailable-subtitle: There's nothing more to cut at the moment. 
on-arrival: labor_expend -= 0.25; efficacy_labor += 0.1 if efficacy_labor < 1; labor_streamline += 8; 

@hire_staff
title: Hire administrative personnel
subtitle: -0.5 resources
on-arrival: efficacy_labor += 0.2 if efficacy_labor < 1; labor_expend += 0.25; resources -= 0.5;

@corruption
title: Root-out departmental corruption. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources
on-arrival: efficacy_labor += 0.1 if efficacy_labor < 1; resources -= 0.5;


@unions
title: UNION AFFAIRS

- #union_options
- @labor_return

@promote_unions
title: Promote the industrial unions and drive up recruitment. 
tags: union_options
on-arrival: {!
  Q.unionists += (Q.workers * 100) + (Q.unionists_strength * 5);
  Q.unionists_strength += 5;
  Q.unionists_unrest -= 2;
!}

@union_commissions
title: Create union commissions in individual enterprises to oversee production. 
tags: union_options
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.industries_syndicalized + 5;
  Q.unionists_strength += 3;
  Q.unionists_unrest -= 3;
!}

@subordinate_factory_committees
title: Subordinate the factory committees, by incorporating them into the unions.
subtitle: The various bodies spontaneously declared by the workers need to be reined in. 
tags: union_options
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.workers_unrest += 10;
  Q.instability -= 1; Q.industry += 0.05; 
  Q.unionists_strength += 5; Q.workers_strength -= 5;
!}

The factory committees emerged as workers spontaneously seized control over their workplaces and established their own management. However, this has led to a decentralized patchwork, with factory committees focusing on their own particular workplace, rather than the interest of the entire economy. Although the process of subordinating the committees inflames tensions and leads to various conflicts on the ground, we are eventually able to organize these committees into a proper system. 



@policies
title: POLICIES

- #labor_policy
- @labor_return

@promote_collegiality
title: Promote collegial management in enterprises. 
subtitle: Factories should be managed by elected councils, rather than any single individual. 
tags: labor_policy
on-arrival: {!
  Q.unionists += (Q.workers * 10) + (Q.unionists_strength * 2.5);
  Q.unionists_unrest -= 5; Q.workers_unrest -= 5;
!}

@moderate_between_unions
title: Affirm the rights of non-Bolshevik-aligned unions.
subtitle: Overt suppression of uncooperative unions is causing controversy. 
max-visits: 1
tags: labor_policy
on-arrival: {!
  Q.instability += 2; 
  Q.unionists += (Q.workers * 10) + (Q.unionists_strength * 2.5);
  Q.unionists_strength += 5; Q.unionists_unrest -= 10;
  Q.m_strength += 5; Q.left_m_strength += 5; 
  Q.moderate_strength += 5; 
!}

By taking a moderate stance in regards to the non-Bolshevik-aligned unions, we're able to greatly ease tensions and mediate a number of local conflicts. The unions in general profit from this, although it especially benefits Menshevik-dominated unions like the Red Printers' Union. 

@labor_propaganda
title: Conduct propaganda against the bourgeois directors and former owners. 
subtitle: Inefficiencies in production are the result of sabotage! 
tags: labor_policy
on-arrival: {!
  Q.workers_unrest -= 4; 
  Q.instability -= 0.5; 
  Q.bourgeois_specialists_unrest += 10; Q.bourgeois_specialists_strength -= 5; 
!}
  
@institute_piecerates
title: Embrace the use of piece-rates to determine worker wages. 
subtitle: This is generally unpopular among workers. 
tags: labor_policy
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.workers_unrest += 8;
  Q.industry += 0.2; 
!}

@harsh_labor_courts
title: Charge the comradely courts with punishing labor violations.
subtitle: Harsher sentences will be given out for absenteeism, poor craftsmenship, drunkenness, etc. 
tags: labor_policy
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.unionists -= (Q.workers * 10);
  Q.workers_unrest += 4; Q.workers_strength += 4; 
  Q.industry += 0.05;
!}

@increase_safety
title: Enforce safety standards and regulations.
choose-if: safety_standards < 3 and resources >= 1
unavailable_subtitle: [?if resources < 1 : We lack the resources. ?][?if safety_standards >= 3 : Safety standards are already highly enforced. ?]
tags: labor_policy
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 1; Q.safety_standards += 1;
  Q.workers_unrest -= 5; Q.workers_b += 3*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.industry -= 0.05; Q.labor_expend += 0.5; 
!}

We increase enforcement of safety regulations at factories, and work to improve working conditions. 

@decrease_safety
title: Slacken safety standards and regulations.
choose-if: safety_standards > 0
unavailable_subtitle: [?if safety_standards = 0 : Safety standards are already nonexistent. ?]
tags: labor_policy
on-arrival: {!
  Q.safety_standards -= 1;
  Q.workers_unrest += 5; Q.workers_b -= 3*(1-Q.b_dissent);
  Q.industry += 0.1; Q.labor_expend -= 0.5; 
!}

We begin turning a blind-eye to certain labor practices, in the hopes of cutting production costs. 



  
@programs
title: PROGRAMS

- #labor_programs
- @labor_return


@worker_provisions
title: Institute a system deducting union dues system from wages automatically, in order to fund worker provisions and welfare programs. 
tags: labor_programs
choose-if: efficacy_labor >= 0.5
unavailable-subtitle: We lack the administrative capacity for this. 
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.unionists += (Q.workers * 100) + (Q.unionists_strength * 5);
  Q.unionists_unrest -= 5; Q.workers_unrest -= 5;
  Q.industry += 0.05; 
  Q.unemployed -= (0.5 + (50 / Q.instability));
!}

@worker_rations
title: Create a program to provide housing, rations, and basic necessities to workers. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources
tags: labor_programs
choose-if: efficacy_labor >= 0.5 and resources >= 0.7
unavailable-subtitle: -0.5 resources – [?if resouces < 0.5 : We lack the resources. ?] [?if efficacy_labor < 0.7 : We lack the administrative capacity for this. ?]
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 0.5; Q.labor_expend += 0.5; 
  Q.unionists += (Q.workers * 100) + (Q.unionists_strength * 5);
  Q.unionists_unrest -= 5; Q.workers_unrest -= 5;
  Q.industry += 0.1; Q.instability -= 0.5;
  Q.unemployed -= (1 + (50 / Q.instability));
!}

@bonuses
title: Charge the unions with setting production norms and administering bonuses. 
subtitle: -0.5 resources
tags: labor_programs
choose-if: efficacy_labor >= 0.5 and resources >= 0.7
unavailable-subtitle: -0.5 resources – [?if resouces < 0.5 : We lack the resources. ?] [?if efficacy_labor < 0.7 : We lack the administrative capacity for this. ?]
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: {!
  Q.resources -= 0.5; Q.labor_expend += 0.5; 
  Q.unionists += (Q.workers * 100) + (Q.unionists_strength * 5);
  Q.unionists_unrest -= 5; Q.workers_unrest -= 5;
  Q.industry += 0.15; Q.instability -= 0.5;
  Q.unemployed -= (0.5 + (50 / Q.instability));
!}


@goto_labor_affairs
title: LABOR AFFAIRS

- #labor_affairs
- @labor_return

  

